<title>JAPAN: Quebec launches 100 bln yen 3.0 pct samurai - Daiwa.</title>
<headline>Quebec launches 100 bln yen 3.0 pct samurai - Daiwa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities on Thursday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Province of Quebec</p>
<p> AMT		 100 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    3.0 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.70</p>
<p> MATURITY	  29 Sept 2009</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  29 July 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	July 17 to July 18</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P A+, Moody's A2, JCR AA</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    n/a</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8584</p>
</text>
